{"id":"comparison-advanced","lv":"b2","n":32,"cat":"comparison","t":"Twice as big, nowhere near as good, by far the best","en":"twice as … as · nowhere near as · by far the…","sum":"So sánh nâng cao. Gấp bao nhiêu lần: twice / three times as + tính từ + as (Hanoi is twice as big as Da Nang) hoặc three times + so sánh hơn + than (three times more expensive than). Kém xa: nowhere near as / not nearly as + tính từ + as (not nearly as expensive). Gần bằng: almost / nearly as … as. Nhấn so sánh nhất: by far the best, easily the best (hơn hẳn). The same … as, similar to, a lot like cho sự giống. Không nói twice bigger than trong văn chuẩn.","forms":[{"f":"twice / three times as + tính từ + as","vi":"twice as big as"},{"f":"nowhere near as / not nearly as + tính từ + as","vi":"nowhere near as good as"},{"f":"by far / easily + so sánh nhất","vi":"by far the best"},{"f":"almost / nearly as … as","vi":"nearly as tall as his dad"}],"pts":[{"id":"comparison-advanced","name":"Advanced comparison","vi":"Twice as…as, nowhere near as, by far the…"}],"cast":{"nam":{"name":{"en":"Nam","vi":"Nam"},"look":"man","style":{"outfit":"shirt","top":"#4F7CC4","topShade":"#3F68A8","accent":"#3F68A8","hair":"fringe","hairColor":"#1F1B1A","skin":"#EFC9A4","skinShade":"#DDB08A"},"x":1040},"ben":{"name":{"en":"Ben","vi":"Ben"},"look":"man","style":{"outfit":"jacket","top":"#5A6B8C","topShade":"#4A5A78","accent":"#4A5F8F","hair":"short","hairColor":"#B8863B"},"x":560}},"bg":"cafe","beats":[{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"How was Tokyo? Is it as big as Hanoi?","vi":"Tokyo thế nào? Có to bằng Hà Nội không?","ipa":["haʊ","wɑz","ˈtoʊkiˌoʊ","ɪz","ɪt","æz","bɪɡ","æz","ˈhænɔɪ"],"who":"ben","ann":{"expression":"thinking"},"b":1,"start":0.476,"end":3.186,"timing":[[0,0.476],[1,0.571],[2,0.759],[3,1.923],[4,2.123],[5,2.224],[6,2.374],[7,2.599],[8,2.736]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Much bigger! Its population is about three times as large as Hanoi's.","vi":"To hơn nhiều! Dân số gấp khoảng ba lần Hà Nội.","ipa":